    "custom_rich_text_columns_fnzgfp": {
      "type": "custom__rich-text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_yAPeEw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Luna Nueva is an additive-free tequila from the Highlands and Lowlands of Jalisco. It is made at the Vivanco family distillery, NOM 1414, one of the most respected producers in Mexico, where the craft of tequila runs generations deep.</h4>",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "position": "left"
          }
        },
        "text_WqbkjF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The agave grows across highland and lowland terrain, each plant taking years to reach its moment. No additives, no shortcuts, no compromise. The liquid is authentic to Mexico. The culture is California.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "position": "left"
          }
        },
        "text_6LQzVF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Three expressions: Silver, Reposado aged seven months, and Añejo aged thirteen months. 100% Blue Weber Agave, additive-free, 750ml.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "position": "right"
          }
        },
        "text_LBNpjA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Co-Founder & CEO Kelsey Selby, a Gen Z California native, spent years inside the hospitality world she loved before recognizing a gap. Luna Nueva exists for a generation that doesn’t settle.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "position": "right"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_yAPeEw",
        "text_WqbkjF",
        "text_6LQzVF",
        "text_LBNpjA"
      ],
